Fourth tracing expansion: 26 addition passes
============================================

Scope
-----
This expansion adds 61 probe definitions in 26 focused passes, spanning
kernel subsystems, hardware drivers, LinuxKPI, both Linuxulator ABIs and
installed base software. Existing probes and unrelated working-tree edits
are preserved. It is additional semantic coverage, not complete coverage of
every subsystem, driver or branch.

coverage-fourth.json inventories the additions, final source hashes, pass
numbers and 17 new BSDInstruments profiles. Per-pass edits and compiler
results, baseline source snapshots, final builds and qualification results
are under /usr/obj/5bsd-dtrace-20-validation. The directory name retains the
original minimum pass count; the completed work contains 26 passes.

